 warn "$(L '重启临时隧道会更换域名，需要重新导入节点。HTTP2 仍需出站 TCP 7844，不能通过 TCP 443 代替。' 'Restarting a Quick Tunnel changes its hostname; re-import the node. HTTP2 still requires outbound TCP 7844, not TCP 443.')"
